    "body": "Good call @bathos. When making these functions available on a ShadowRealm's global, we'll need to make sure this global object is acceptable as the receiver, and more importantly, that in the absence of a receiver it's this ShadowRealm's global object being used as fallback receiver and not the principal realm's global object.",
